%N A399976 Number of sublattices of index n in generic n-dimensional lattice.
%H A399976 Alois P. Heinz, <a href="/A399976/b399976.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..387</a>
%F A399976 a(n) = A128119(n,n) = A160870(n,n).
%p A399976 b:= proc(n, k) option remember; `if`(min(n, k)=1, 1,
